#: data/maps/OldaleTown_Mart/scripts.inc:55
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Mart_Text_PokeBallsAreSoldOut"
msgid ""
"The clerk says they're all sold out.\n"
"I can't buy any POKé BALLS.$"
msgstr ""
"店员说已经全部卖完了。\n"
"买不到精灵球了。$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown_Mart/scripts.inc:59
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Mart_Text_ImGoingToBuyPokeBalls"
msgid ""
"I'm going to buy a bunch of POKé BALLS\n"
"and catch a bunch of POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"我要买好多好多精灵球，\n"
"然后捉好多好多宝可梦！$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown_Mart/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "OldaleTown_Mart_Text_RestoreHPWithPotion"
msgid ""
"If a POKéMON gets hurt and loses its HP\n"
"and faints, it won't be able to battle.\p"
"To prevent your POKéMON from fainting,\n"
"restore its HP with a POTION.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦受伤后HP会减少，\n"
"要是陷入濒死状态，就不能对战了。\p"
"为了不让宝可梦陷入濒死，\n"
"要用伤药来回复它的HP哦。$"
